{"3098380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Locked In", "steam_appid": 3098380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Locked In | traps players in a constantly changing house, where they must solve intricate puzzles and confront a malevolent ghost...<br><br>The protagonist is trapped in a time loop, reliving the same eerie night over and over. The house, once familiar, becomes increasingly distorted and unsettling with each cycle. As the night progresses, the player's surroundings twist into a nightmare filled with dark, oppressive atmospheres and cryptic messages scrawled on the walls. The ghostly presence haunts their every move, emerging from unexpected places.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098380/extras/407f2c95755cf30baa953a578b081a98.poster.avif?t=1760969541\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098380/extras/407f2c95755cf30baa953a578b081a98.webm?t=1760969541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098380/extras/407f2c95755cf30baa953a578b081a98.mp4?t=1760969541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Realistic Graphics: Detailed environments that enhance the immersive horror experience.<br>Intricate Puzzles: Challenges that test your problem-solving skills and unravel the story.<br>Terrifying Ghost Encounter: Face a frightening female ghost with a chilling backstory.<br>Dynamic Gameplay: Each playthrough offers new scares and environmental changes, ensuring a fresh experience every time.", "about_the_game": "Locked In | traps players in a constantly changing house, where they must solve intricate puzzles and confront a malevolent ghost...<br><br>The protagonist is trapped in a time loop, reliving the same eerie night over and ove